# Omarchy port: take only the media stack from Intel's graphics PPA, for an
# Intel GPU on the xe driver (install/13-intel-media-root.sh). The PPA also
# carries a kernel, the compute runtime and GPU management tools; those never
# come from it. The media stanza comes first so it wins over the catch-all.
